  "label": "Context of racial stereotyping in memes",
  "description": "The meme relies on the broader context of racial stereotyping, where certain racial groups are caricatured or mocked based on false or exaggerated traits. In this case, the stereotype about swimming ability is used to create a humorous or mocking effect, which is inherently harmful due to its reliance on a derogatory racial trope.",
